on', 'value': 'qualified'}\nfinal.qualification.status {'evaluation_scope': 'sealed_final', 'id': 'final.qualification.status', 'manifest_path': 'work/results/t02/codex/20261117_205843/final_evaluation/final_manifest.json', 'program_tree_sha256': 'sha256:28c0407d4c255b8c094419443308bf86ec8da1057bc953ba16080d6ff6cd0da2', 'results_tree_sha256': 'sha256:5accdfe6862bbd7ae5e2b40491fa88eda6c445c16c2893fefe058dd0ce0b33c2', 'type': 'final_qualification', 'value': 'completed'}\nstrategy keys: ['status', 'selected_prompt_family', 'recommended_title', 'central_question', 'central_thesis', 'narrative_rationale', 'prior_paper_story_status', 'edit_framing_decision', 'staged_input_impact', 'method_groups', 'results_focus', 'figure_plan', 'figure_specs', 'supplementary_plan', 'forbidden_headings', 'forbidden_phrases', 'notes_for_writer', 'failure_reason']\ncentral_thesis Across the tested modular addition and subtraction conditions, wider fixed-rate MLPs attain sustained memorization earlier or attain it when the narrowest models do not, yet none attains sustained generalization within 20,000 updates; the reported width-lag contrast therefore reflects memorization and endpoint substitution, not an identified effect on grokking time.\nfailure_reason \nclaim count: 39\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
